What are Power Tailgate Systems?
Power tailgate systems are sophisticated automotive components designed to automate the opening and closing of vehicle tailgates or liftgates. These systems utilize electric motors and can be operated through various methods such as key fobs, dashboard buttons, or hands-free sensors with kick-activated technology. By eliminating the need for manual lifting, they significantly enhance user convenience - particularly for individuals carrying heavy loads or those with mobility challenges. Beyond convenience, these systems also improve vehicle security by ensuring proper closure and often integrate with the vehicle's central locking system.
